  "description": "A build-time library that reads the REST controllers and SignalR hubs of a compiled .NET backend, without running it, and writes the typed Rust client code a WebAssembly frontend calls them with. It refuses a backend whose contract is not fully declared, listing every gap at once. It is used while an application is built and is not part of the built application.",
